      /\ getr regs' 2 = Z_to_bv 64 s /\ getr regs' 1 = ret /\ getr regs' 10 = Z_to_bv 64 msg /\ getr regs' 11 = Z_to_bv 64 0x11fb2 /\ getr regs' 12 = Z_to_bv 64 0
      /\ (forall x, In x [8; 9]%bv -> getr regs' x = getr r0 x)
      /\ regs_agree (fun x => In x [1; 2; 8; 9; 12]%list) regs regs'.
Proof.
    intros fr0 fr cs regs r0 m s msg ret Hs Hs64 CF H2 H10 H11.
    unfold frameb in CF; cbn [cellsZ] in CF; destruct CF as (C1 & C2 & C3 & C4 & C5 & _).
    eexists. split.
    - zv F_3b580 D_3b580 (Z_to_bv 64 0).
      stepLD8 F_3b584 D_3b584 ret.
      stepLD8 F_3b588 D_3b588 (getr r0 8).
